      },
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 560,
      "data": {
        "title": "Changed",
        "body": "- A Twilite account starts with your email, with a code and no password. GitHub connects to it afterwards, when you save to your repository.\n- Sign In and Create Account are separate, and say what each is for.\n- Every node you can edit now has an Edit button on its card, with Done and Cancel, instead of a pencil in the title bar. The resize handle shows while you edit.",
